      "writtenOn": "2019-07-12T20:39:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC, you\u0027re just adding the hook to print an avc denied on EACCES? That seems odd (and wrong). An LSM hook should actually be enforcing a security decision.",
